  {
    "file": "p01-04_logit.png",
    "width": 900,
    "height": 815,
    "nonGrayBefore": 0,
    "grayscale": true,
    "sha256": "15dbe10be3a242050e58825316c3f953a87665d743b654cc78161bd0c74987d6",
    "text_bounds": [
      {
        "text": "把概率变成分数，再把分数还原为概率",
        "x": 40,
        "y": 20,
        "width": 595,
        "height": 49
      },
      {
        "text": "p 是概率；z 是无单位分数。这里只演示函数，不训练模型。",
        "x": 40,
        "y": 76,
        "width": 588.265625,
        "height": 30
      },
      {
        "text": "正向：z = logit(p) = ln[p ÷ (1−p)]",
        "x": 40,
        "y": 142,
        "width": 473.84375,
        "height": 44
      },
      {
        "text": "p = 0.5",
        "x": 62,
        "y": 229,
        "width": 93.75,
        "height": 40
      },
      {
        "text": "0.5÷0.5 = 1",
        "x": 317,
        "y": 230,
        "width": 140.546875,
        "height": 38
      },
      {
        "text": "ln(1) = 0",
        "x": 636,
        "y": 232,
        "width": 94.5625,
        "height": 36
      },
      {
        "text": "p = 0.8",
        "x": 62,
        "y": 335,
        "width": 93.75,
        "height": 40
      },
      {
        "text": "0.8÷0.2 = 4",
        "x": 317,
        "y": 336,
        "width": 145.921875,
        "height": 38
      },
      {
        "text": "ln(4) ≈ 1.386",
        "x": 636,
        "y": 338,
        "width": 150.90625,
        "height": 36
      },
      {
        "text": "反向：p = 1 ÷ [1 + exp(−z)]",
        "x": 40,
        "y": 417,
        "width": 390.703125,
        "height": 44
      },
      {
        "text": "z = 0     →  exp(0) = 1       →  p = 1÷2 = 0.5",
        "x": 64,
        "y": 503,
        "width": 428.390625,
        "height": 37
      },
      {
        "text": "z = ln4  →  exp(−ln4) = ¼  →  p = 1÷1.25 = 0.8",
        "x": 64,
        "y": 551,
        "width": 539.5625,
        "height": 37
      },
      {
        "text": "ln 是以 e 为底的对数；exp(−z) 就是 e 的 −z 次幂。",
        "x": 40,
        "y": 659,
        "width": 564.15625,
        "height": 33
      },
      {
        "text": "正向必须 0 < p < 1；p 为 0 或 1 时不能直接代入有限公式。",
        "x": 40,
        "y": 705,
        "width": 614.421875,
        "height": 32
      },
      {
        "text": "概率 0.8 = 80%，赔率为 4；赔率 4 不等于概率 400%。",
        "x": 40,
        "y": 750,
        "width": 587.421875,
        "height": 32
      }
    ],
    "overflow": []
  }
